        <imsmd:language>en</imsmd:language>
        <imsmd:description>
          <imsmd:langstring xml:lang="en">This course teaches employees the fundamentals of workplace fire prevention, including how to identify common fire hazards before they become emergencies. Learners practice the correct operation of portable fire extinguishers using the PASS technique. The course concludes with evacuation procedures, assembly point protocol, and a short mastery quiz.</imsmd:langstring>
